      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تصفّر المَالُ</span></b>  <i>The cattle became in good condition, the vehement heat of summer having departed from them:</i> [or,] accord. to Sgh, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تصفّرت</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الإِبِلُ</span> signifies <i>The camels became fat in the</i>
[<i>season called the</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَفَرِيَّة</span>. (TA.)

